## What is the Landing Website?

The Landing Website is a **public-facing marketing website** that anyone can visit in their browser. Its one and only goal is to explain what the Intelligent Database Migration Planner is, make it look impressive and professional, and get the user to click the **"Download for Windows"** button to get the `.exe` file.

The user **does not** migrate any database on this website. It is purely informational.

